229: * suffix only on a semantics-changing lock change (added waiters / xact-scoped),
230: * never on a code refactor — the value is a wire contract between concurrent kbs. */
231:#define DB2_DIM_LOCK_KEY "aimee_dim_bootstrap_v1"
