430: * owner-only DDL. The schema is applied by a separate migrate/owner step; here we
431: * VERIFY (read-only) that the migrated schema is present, current, and dim-
432: * compatible, and fail closed otherwise — never attempting the apply. Every query
433: * is a plain SELECT / catalog lookup a non-owner runtime role may run. Called only
434: * when db2_hardening_enabled(); the dev/owner path still auto-applies as before. */
435:static int db2_verify_pre_provisioned(void *conn, int expected_dim, char *err, size_t errlen)
436:{
437:   /* 1. Embedding dim: recorded (proves the migrate ran) and equal to what this kb
438:    *    will size its halfvec columns / readers to. */
439:   int recorded_dim = 0;
