566:    * server's own identity (App token / AIMEE_FORGE_TOKEN); plus the principal's
567:    * vaulted SSH agent. The token crosses only via GIT_ASKPASS, never argv. */
568:   /* FD mode (#3A.2): the HTTPS token rides an inherited memfd (token_fd), so the
569:    * clone child's /proc/<pid>/environ never carries it (parity with run_git). */
