95:       * environ makes execvp pass exactly envp, so ONLY envp's entries survive and
96:       * every inherited variable — including engine secrets (AIMEE_APPROVAL_KEY,
97:       * vault tokens) — is dropped. (envp == NULL keeps the inherited environment;
98:       * that path is used by callers that build a full env themselves.) Portable —
99:       * no execvpe needed. */
