87:    *
88:    * git runs GIT_SSH_COMMAND through the shell, so the spliced path must be
89:    * shell-safe: `<base>/webusers/<name>/known_hosts` where <base> is a
90:    * server-controlled runtime dir and <name> is charset-restricted to
91:    * [A-Za-z0-9._-] (ws_scope_name_valid) — no whitespace/metacharacters from
92:    * any untrusted input can appear. */
